<title>USA: Jones Intercable Investors Q3 share rises.</title>
<headline>Jones Intercable Investors Q3 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.06		    $0.05</p>
<p> Net		 531,317		  442,609</p>
<p> Revs		8,092,507		7,522,301</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,322,632		8,322,632</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.17		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net		 1,426,024		1,173,110</p>
<p> Revs		23,908,825	     22,246,502</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,322,632		8,322,632</p>
<p>Full company name is Jones Intercable Investors LP</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said higher third quarter 1996 revenues for its cable television system were mostly due to increases in the number of basic subscribers and basic service rates. Subscribers increased by about 2,407, or three percent compared to the third quarter 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
